Ledlight matches Ledger for basic transactions.

========== CLI ==========

ledlight transactions

========== LEDGER-CLI ==========

ledger --args-only --date-format %Y-%m-%d print

========== FILE ==========

commodity SEK
  default
  format 1,000.00 SEK
account Assets:Cash
account Equity:Opening
account Expenses:Food
account Income:Salary

2024-01-01 Opening balances
  Assets:Cash  1000.00 SEK
  Equity:Opening

2024-01-15 Groceries
  Expenses:Food  125.50 SEK
  Assets:Cash

2024-02-01 Salary
  Assets:Cash  2500.00 SEK
  Income:Salary

========== OUTPUT ==========

2024-01-01 Opening balances
    Assets:Cash                         1,000.00 SEK
    Equity:Opening

2024-01-15 Groceries
    Expenses:Food                         125.50 SEK
    Assets:Cash

2024-02-01 Salary
    Assets:Cash                         2,500.00 SEK
    Income:Salary
